%% Sequence diagram for submitting a grievance

sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User Browser
  participant V as Vercel Frontend
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant K as Keycloak
  participant S as Grievance Service
  participant PG as Postgres
  participant KF as Kafka
  participant N as Notification Service
  participant SMTP as SMTP/SendGrid

  U->>V: Click Submit Grievance
  V->>G: Submit grievance request
  G->>K: Validate token (Introspect/JWKS)
  G->>S: POST /api/grievances/submit
  S->>PG: INSERT grievance
  S->>KF: Produce grievance.submitted
  KF->>N: Consume event and send notification
  N->>SMTP: Send email
